       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DA3HEXOPERAND.
      *> DA3 - A HEXADECIMAL-ALPHANUMERIC LITERAL IS AN ALPHANUMERIC
      *> LITERAL. 8.3.3.2 FORMAT 2 IS THE HEXADECIMAL FORMAT *OF* THE
      *> ALPHANUMERIC LITERAL, AND 8.3.3.2.1 MAKES EVERY FORMAT OF IT
      *> "OF THE CLASS AND CATEGORY ALPHANUMERIC". SO X"..." BELONGS
      *> WHEREVER AN ALPHANUMERIC LITERAL BELONGS.
      *>
      *> ⛔ IT DID NOT. A RELATION CONDITION STAGED LOUD AT RUN TIME
      *> ("comparison operand") WHILE THE SAME LITERAL WORKED IN A
      *> MOVE - BECAUSE THE "NON-NUMERIC LITERAL -> OPERAND" CHAIN
      *> EXISTED IN *THREE* HAND-MAINTAINED COPIES AND ONLY TWO HAD
      *> THE HEX ARM. THE FIX EXTRACTED ONE MAPPING; THIS GOLDEN PINS
      *> ALL THREE POSITIONS SO A FOURTH COPY CANNOT DRIFT AGAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A PIC X(2) VALUE "ab".
       01 T PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
       01 R PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
      *> POSITION 1 - A RELATION CONDITION (8.8.4.1.1 ADMITS A
      *> LITERAL ON EITHER SIDE). X"6162" IS "ab".
           IF A = X"6162"
               DISPLAY "CMP=EQ"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "CMP=NE"
           END-IF.
      *> POSITION 2 - A MOVE SENDING OPERAND.
           MOVE X"6162" TO T.
           DISPLAY "MOV=[" T "]".
      *> POSITION 3 - AN INTRINSIC ARGUMENT. 15.x ADMITS AN
      *> ALPHANUMERIC LITERAL, AND THIS IS ONE.
           COMPUTE R = FUNCTION LENGTH(X"61626364").
           DISPLAY "LEN=" R.
           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(X"6162") TO T.
           DISPLAY "UPP=[" T "]".
           STOP RUN.
